1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,380
This fake Saudi prince fooled people for about thirty years. Then he ordered dinner.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,460
So who was he? A Florida man named Anthony, zero royal blood.

3
00:00:10,960 --> 00:00:14,480
Actually, he was a con man, a guy who lies to take people's money.

4
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:18,500
But his lie was huge. He said he was a Saudi prince.

5
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:21,660
So why would any— why would anybody believe that?

6
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:26,400
First, his Ferrari had diplomatic plates, the special plates foreign officials get.

7
00:00:26,740 --> 00:00:31,260
Then his bodyguards carried diplomatic security badges, like real government agents.

8
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:33,360
Tap the heart if you'd have believed him too.

9
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:37,820
Okay, investors did. That's people who hand over money hoping it grows.

10
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:40,040
And they lost more than eight million dollars.

11
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:44,180
Spend a thousand bucks every day. It'd last about twenty-two years.

12
00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:46,980
But the plates were fake, and so were the badges.

13
00:00:47,620 --> 00:00:50,000
Send this to the friend who thinks nice cars mean rich.

14
00:00:50,520 --> 00:00:55,880
It gets dumber. Prosecutors said he'd been arrested or convicted eleven times for playing royalty.

15
00:00:56,380 --> 00:00:59,900
He pleaded guilty, and he was sentenced to more than eighteen years in prison.

16
00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:02,640
That's a newborn growing up and finishing high school.

17
00:01:03,220 --> 00:01:07,420
After thirty years, what finally tipped somebody off? Not the car or the badges.

18
00:01:07,940 --> 00:01:10,340
Follow, this page never skips the slip-up.

19
00:01:10,700 --> 00:01:12,620
At one dinner, the prince ordered pork.

20
00:01:13,220 --> 00:01:17,080
Here's why. Saudi royals are Muslim, and Islam forbids eating pork.

21
00:01:17,360 --> 00:01:21,180
So his character would never order it. A victim noticed, and got suspicious.

22
00:01:22,120 --> 00:01:26,380
Thirty years of lies, and a dinner order is what raised the red flag. Would you have caught it?

